<fw type="sig" place="bottom">R 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Der</fw><lb/>
<pb n="262" facs="#f0304"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#aq">IX.</hi> Leop. u. Jo&#x017F;eph <hi rendition="#aq">I.</hi> 1657-1711.</hi></fw><lb/>
Der ganze Reichstag bekam al&#x017F;o unvermerkt die<lb/>
